Package: agentstack
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd, libc6 (>= 2.38), libtinfo6, ca-certificates, git
Description: local supervisor for pinned AgentStack engines
 AgentStack runs a per-user systemd service that owns its pinned native
 engine processes. The package only installs the product; the intended user
 explicitly enables and starts the user service.
